{
  "id": "2026-10-17-renoir-behind-wall",
  "title": "Two stolen Renoir paintings turned up hidden behind a wall",
  "topic": "일상",
  "level": 2,
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
  "sentences": [
    "Good morning!",
    "Today's story sounds like a movie, but it really happened in France.",
    "Last month, thieves broke into a small museum in the south of the country.",
    "They got away with two paintings by Renoir, the famous French artist.",
    "In their hurry, they actually dropped two other works on the way out.",
    "All four paintings together are worth about ten million dollars.",
    "For weeks, there was no sign of them.",
    "Then police searched a house in another town and found both paintings hidden behind a wall.",
    "The prosecutor said they were completely undetectable.",
    "Six people were arrested, and DNA evidence helped police charge the main suspect.",
    "The bad news is that the paintings didn't come back in perfect shape.",
    "One canvas has a tear, and one frame is slightly damaged, so both will need restoration.",
    "This is the latest in a string of museum thefts in France, including a huge jewel theft at the Louvre last year.",
    "So here's a question for your next coffee break.",
    "If you could hang any famous painting in your living room, which one would you pick?"
  ],
  "summary_ko": [
    "지난달 프랑스 남부의 한 미술관에서 르누아르 그림 두 점이 도난당했다 (함께 떨어뜨리고 간 두 점까지 합쳐 약 1천만 달러어치).",
    "경찰이 다른 마을의 한 집을 수색해 벽 뒤에 숨겨진 그림을 찾았고, 6명을 체포했으며 DNA 증거로 주범을 기소했다.",
    "그림은 찢어지고 액자가 상해 복원이 필요하다. 루브르 보석 도난에 이은 프랑스 미술관 연쇄 절도의 하나다."
  ],
